auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Dropdown Options
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/usulan-pengabdian/options`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  No request body required.
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil options",
    "data": {
      "tahunAkademik": [
        { "id": "uuid", "tahun": "2024/2025", "is_active": true }
      ],
      "hibahInternal": [
        { "id": "uuid", "nama": "Hibah Pengabdian", "is_active": true }
      ],
      "kategoriPublikasi": [
        { "id": "uuid", "nama": "Jurnal Nasional" }
      ],
      "mitraKerja": [
        { "id": "uuid", "nama": "Desa Sukamaju" }
      ],
      "productRiset": [
        { "id": "uuid", "nama": "Pelatihan" }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
